#. type: Title ##
#: docs/product/anima-uri.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grammar"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/product/anima-uri.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "anima:{id}[?component={component}][&present=navigate|overlay]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/anima-uri.md:34
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Attribute  | Value                                                                                                                                                 |\n"
#| "| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Trigger    | Sleep-cycle step `deep-sleep` (after light-sleep in DAG)                                                                                              |\n"
#| "| Target     | All active semantic memory                                                                                                                            |\n"
#| "| Operations | Contradiction detection + expiry marking, split, dedup merge, pin quality review—four sequential rounds                                               |\n"
#| "| Mode       | **Incremental** (scheduled Tue–Sun): skip quiet rounds when nothing was `updated` in 24h; **Full** (scheduled Mon + manual): all rounds on full store |\n"
msgid ""
"| Part        | Meaning                                                                                                                                       |\n"
"| ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `id`        | `entities.id` (positive integer)                                                                                                              |\n"
"| `component` | Component tag used as the **view facet** (which overlay / module mapping). Optional; if omitted, open resolves **`primary_component`**        |\n"
"| `present`   | `navigate` = switch Shell module and select; `overlay` = open registered overlay. Defaults depend on component (e.g. `task_item` → `overlay`) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 属性  | 值                                                                                                |\n"
"| ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 触发    | sleep-cycle 步骤 `deep-sleep`（DAG 中在 light-sleep 之后）                                             |\n"
"| 目标     | 全部 active 语义记忆                                                                           |\n"
"| 操作 | 矛盾检测 + 过期标记、拆分、去重合并、置顶维护——四轮顺序执行 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/anima-uri.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "**No short aliases** (e.g. `task` is invalid). Values must be full component names.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/anima-uri.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Do not use** `anima://…` as the normative form (id would be mis-parsed as URL host; `anima://42:task_item` is an invalid URL).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/anima-uri.md:40
msgid ""
"Same `id` with different `component=` can open **different** overlays "
"(entity may carry multiple `components[]`). Registry key is the component "
"tag, not the Shell module id."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/product/anima-uri.md:41
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Data Persistence"
msgid "Layering vs persistence"
msgstr "数据持久化"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/anima-uri.md:47
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Capability        | Description                                                                                            |\n"
#| "| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
#| "| `memory_recall`   | Four sources: semantic / conversation / limbic / autobiographical; Top N; conversation returns snippet |\n"
#| "| `sessions_search` | Session message search; returns snippet (not full content)                                             |\n"
#| "| `memory_remember` | Semantic memory CRUD during conversation                                                               |\n"
#| "| Resident memory   | System prompt injection (not recall)                                                                   |\n"
msgid ""
"| Layer                   | Stores                                         | Anima URI                                                 |\n"
"| ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| PG / Habitat body / RPC | Entity **`id`** (e.g. pomodoro `task_item_id`) | **Never** as FK string                                    |\n"
"| Shell UI                | —                                              | `formatAnimaUri` / `parseAnimaUri` / `openEntityResource` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 能力              | 说明                                                                                                   |\n"
"| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `memory_recall`   | 四源：semantic / conversation / limbic / autobiographical；Top N；conversation 返回 snippet            |\n"
"| `sessions_search` | 会话消息搜索；返回 snippet（非全文）                                                                   |\n"
"| `memory_remember` | 对话中语义记忆 CRUD                                                                                    |\n"
"| Resident memory   | system prompt 注入（非 recall）                                                                        |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/product/anima-uri.md:49
msgid ""
"Anima URI is a **Shell/UI locator protocol**, not a database foreign key. "
"User-authored body text that happens to contain `anima:…` is content, not a "
"structured relation."
msgstr ""

